  "audio_url": "/audio/russian/5430_colour.mp3",
  "english_paragraphs": [
    "It may be difficult for ordinary people to understand the importance of color. A twelve-year-old boy, Jonathan, has severe color blindness. After his principal lent the boy his glasses, he started crying. It turns out that his principal also has color blindness. These glasses are specially made for color blindness. This is the first time the little boy can see different colors clearly. It turns out that the world with colors is like this."
  ],
  "english_full": "It may be difficult for ordinary people to understand the importance of color. A twelve-year-old boy, Jonathan, has severe color blindness. After his principal lent the boy his glasses, he started crying. It turns out that his principal also has color blindness. These glasses are specially made for color blindness. This is the first time the little boy can see different colors clearly. It turns out that the world with colors is like this.",
  "russian_paragraphs": [
    "Мо́жет быть, для обы́чных лю́дей тру́дно понима́ть ва́жность цвета́. Двенадца́ти́летний ма́льчик Ионафа́н име́ет тяжёлый дальтони́зм. По́сле того́ как гла́вный дал ему́ свои́ стекло́, он на́чал плакать. Ока́залось, что его́ гла́вный то́же име́ет дальтони́зм. Эти́ стекло́ специаль́но сде́ланы для дальтони́зма. Это пе́рвый раз, когда ма́льчик может видéть рaзные цвета́ я́сно. Ока́залось, что мир с цветами́ такой."
  ],
  "reading_paragraphs": [
    "Mózhet byt', dlya obýchnykh lyúdey trúdno ponimát' vázhnost' tsvéta. Dvenadtsátiletnij mál'chik Ionafán iméet tyazhélyj dal'tonízm. Pósle tógo kak glávnyj dal emú svoí stekló, on náchal plakat'. Okázalos', chto egó glávnyj tózhe iméet dal'tonízm. Etí stekló spetsial'nó sdélany dlya dal'tonízma. Eto pérvyj raz, kogda mál'chik mózhет vidéť ráznye tsvéta yásno. Okázalos', chto mir s tsvetamí takoj."
  ],
